{"id":"anker","lemma":"Anker","pos":"noun","rank":4647,"glosses":["anchor"],"ipa":"/ˈʔaŋkɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/De-Anker.ogg/De-Anker.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Ankers","plural":"Anker"},"examples":[{"text":"Jedes Schiff braucht einen Anker.","en":"Every ship needs an anchor.","words":[{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Das Schiff setzte seinen Anker.","en":"The ship dropped anchor.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"to sit down","l":"setzen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ein großes Schiff liegt in der Nähe vor Anker.","en":"A big ship is anchored near here.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},null,null,null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null],"phrases":[[4,7,"near"]]},{"text":"Ich trage am rechten Arm einen tätowierten Anker.","en":"I have a tattoo of an anchor on my right arm.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"to argue"},{"g":"an arm"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"to tattoo","l":"tätowieren"},null]},{"text":"Tom warf den Anker über Bord.","en":"Tom threw the anchor overboard.","words":[null,{"g":"to throw","l":"werfen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"shelf"}]}]}